msgctxt "80"
msgid "Thank you for everything you've been doing, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "This is the information we have on the boss of the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Thank you very much. I'm sorry I can't come with you. I hope everything "
"goes well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Whenever you want to go up to the roof of the Millennium Tower just talk to "
"one of my men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "When you're ready, let me know. I'll be waiting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Shinzaki contacted us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "He did? What did he have to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Hello? Ibuki speaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "HLA? This is Shinzaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "I'm only gonna say this once, so listen up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Tell Kazuma Kiryu to come to the roof of the Millennium Tower. Alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "He can meet the boss there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "*beep* *beep* *beep*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Wait, hold⑬ Hello!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Hello!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "He wants me to go alone? Fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, it's obviously a trap. If you go alone, you'll play right into "
"their hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"But if I lose out on this opportunity, it'll be hard to track them down "
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "I know, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "I've beaten the odds on my own before. Don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "...I understand. You sure you want to go ahead with this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure. Let's end this thing once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Thank you very much. I'm sorry I can't come with you. I hope everything "
"goes well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"Whenever you want to go up to the Millennium Tower roof, just talk to one "
"of my men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Let me know when you're ready. I'll be waiting for you."
msgstr ""

